SUMMARY:Wild Horse Nine
LOCATION:Images Cinema\, 50 Spring St\, Williamstown\, MA 01267
DESCRIPTION:Times: 1:45pm\, 4:15pm\, 6:45pm\, 9:15pm\nShortly before the 19
 73 Chilean coup\, CIA agents Chris and Lee are dispatched from Santiago to
  Easter Island by their bureau chief\, MJ. Amongst the Island's iconic sta
 tues\, and as the longtime partners wrestle with their dark pasts and pres
 ent conspiracies\, Chris's newfound bond with a pair of rebellious student
 s threatens to send everyone’s trip to this remote paradise sideways.\nh
 ttps://www.imagescinema.org/movie/wild-horse-nine\nFrom Pushpin Western Ma
 ss: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.imagescinema.org/movie/wild-horse-nine
END:VEVENT
