SUMMARY:Fjord
LOCATION:Images Cinema\, 50 Spring St\, Williamstown\, MA 01267
DESCRIPTION:Following the deaths of Mihai's parents\, Mihai and Lisbet Gheo
 rghiu leave their life behind in Romania and move with their children to a
  remote village in Norway\, hoping to rebuild their lives near Lisbet's fa
 mily. There\, they grow close to their neighbors\, the Halbergs\, whose wa
 rmth gives them hope for a fresh start. But the fragile peace begins to un
 ravel when the Gheorghiu family’s young daughter\, Elia\, arrives at sch
 ool covered in bruises.\nhttps://www.imagescinema.org/movie/fjord\nFrom Pu
 shpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.imagescinema.org/movie/fjord
END:VEVENT
