SUMMARY:Dune: Part Three
LOCATION:Images Cinema\, 50 Spring St\, Williamstown\, MA 01267
DESCRIPTION:Times: 3:30pm\, 6:30pm\, 9:30pm\nNearly two decades after he se
 ized control of the Imperium\, Paul Atreides is now a ruthless Emperor\, a
 nd must face the consequences of his reign as old allies return\, terrifyi
 ng new threats emerge\, and betrayal lurks in every shadow. Haunted by vis
 ions of Imperial collapse and the reappearance of his long-lost love\, Pau
 l is drawn into a sweeping conspiracy\, with Chani at the heart of its unf
 olding mystery. As enemies close in\, Paul must confront the true cost of 
 power and the fate of those he loves the most.\nhttps://www.imagescinema.o
 rg/movie/dune-part-three\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/
 westernma/
URL:https://www.imagescinema.org/movie/dune-part-three
END:VEVENT
